     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/bcf39e26-CCC_Logo_650px-300x254.png\" alt=\"Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"300\" height=\"254\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/CCC_Logo_650px-300x254.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/95c5c457-CCC_Logo_650px.png\"></p><p>Get instant updates for New Product Drops, Bundle Offers, and alerts delivered straight to your device from Cape Cod Cannabis — no matter where you are.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Are Web Push Notifications?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Web Push Notifications are quick messages sent to your browser—even when you’re not on the site.<em> No app needed and you can unsubscribe at any time.</em></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "How to Enable Notifications"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ol><li>Visit our website in Chrome, Firefox, or Edge.</li><li>Click <strong>Allow</strong> on the notification prompt.</li><li>Manage notifications anytime in your browser settings <em>(allow pop-ups, etc.)</em>.</li><li>Please clear your browser cache and refresh our site if you do not see our notification window (below).</li><li>Cannot subscribe while in Incognito or private browsing mode</li></ol><p><img src=\"assets/source/2466267b-Web-Push-Notifcations.png\" alt=\"Allow Web Push Notifications for Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"729\" height=\"423\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Web-Push-Notifcations.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Are iOS Push Notifications?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>iOS Push Notifications send alerts directly to your iPhone or iPad from apps or supported websites.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "How to Enable iOS Notifications"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ol><li>Go to <a href=\"/\">https://capecodcannabis.com</a> on your iOS browser</li><li>Add our website to your Home Screen and Save</li><li>Open the CCC icon from the home screen (not the browser)</li><li>Interact with our subscribe button “Save Preferences” to trigger the native permission prompt.</li></ol><p><img src=\"assets/source/d47e286b-iOS-Push-Notifications.png\" alt=\"Allow iOS Push Notifications for Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"779\" height=\"739\" title=\"Allow iOS Push Notifications for Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/iOS-Push-Notifications.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Manage Your Notifications"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li>Customize or disable notifications anytime.</li><li>Ensure device and browser settings allow alerts.</li><li>Stay connected with real-time updates and offers.</li></ul><p> <br> </p>"
    }
